            "pubkit lock, and so pubkit bump, works where pip is not installed, as in the environments uvx and ./pubkit make: it runs the pip wheel Python's ensurepip carries. The with-secrets.json pubkit seeds points at pubkit's README for its settings, as the one-line with-secrets has no header to explain them."
